  "name": "@lonca/baron-mcp-server",
  "readme": "# @lonca/baron-mcp-server\n\nBaron MCP server: drive issues, scm, ci, deploy, and notify across providers from any MCP client.\n\nPart of **[Baron](https://github.com/loncadev/baron)** \u2014 a platform-agnostic work-orchestration layer for AI coding agents:\none pane of glass (issues, scm, ci, deploy, notify) across providers, via MCP + CLI.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\nnpx -y @lonca/baron-mcp-server\n```\n\n## Documentation\n\nSee the [Baron documentation](https://github.com/loncadev/baron#readme). Source: [`packages/mcp-server`](https://github.com/loncadev/baron/tree/main/packages/mcp-server).\n\n## License\n\n[Apache-2.0](./LICENSE) \u00a9 Baron contributors.\n",
  "readmeFilename": "",
